1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"eyebrow":"Start from your real level","title":"Online Quran Classes for Adults","description":"Private online Quran classes for adults who are beginning with Arabic letters, returning after a break or working on reading, Tajweed or memorization.","compact":true,"children":[["$","$Lc",null,{"className":"button button-ivory","href":"/free-assessment/","children":["Book free assessment ",["$","$Ld",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$a:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right"}]]}],["$","$L10",null,{"className":"button button-ghost-light","children":[["$","$Ld",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719","key":"1sd12s"}]],"className":"lucide-message-circle"}]," Ask about this course"]}]]}],["$","$L11",null,{"items":[{"name":"Home","href":"/"},{"name":"Courses","href":"/courses/"},{"name":"Online Quran Classes for Adults"}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section section-paper","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell content-grid","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"prose","children":[[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Course overview"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Learn Quran online as an adult without repeating what you already know"}],[["$","p","Adults arrive with very different starting points. Some cannot yet recognize Arabic letters, some learned as children but have forgotten the joining patterns, and others can read while repeating pronunciation or Tajweed mistakes. QuranCrest begins with a private assessment so the plan starts from the first useful skill rather than placing every adult in the same beginner lesson.",{"children":"Adults arrive with very different starting points. Some cannot yet recognize Arabic letters, some learned as children but have forgotten the joining patterns, and others can read while repeating pronunciation or Tajweed mistakes. QuranCrest begins with a private assessment so the plan starts from the first useful skill rather than placing every adult in the same beginner lesson."}],["$","p","Live one-to-one lessons provide space to read aloud, ask questions and repeat a difficult word without the pressure of keeping pace with a group. The tutor can adapt the explanation and practice target to the learner's confidence, existing knowledge and available study time.",{"children":"Live one-to-one lessons provide space to read aloud, ask questions and repeat a difficult word without the pressure of keeping pace with a group. The tutor can adapt the explanation and practice target to the learner's confidence, existing knowledge and available study time."}],["$","p","This adult-learning page is a pathway into the appropriate Quran course. Depending on the assessment, the first stage may be Noorani Qaida, guided Quran Reading, applied Tajweed, selected memorization or a combination introduced gradually. Progress is reviewed through skills the learner can apply, not by age or pages completed alone.",{"children":"This adult-learning page is a pathway into the appropriate Quran course. Depending on the assessment, the first stage may be Noorani Qaida, guided Quran Reading, applied Tajweed, selected memorization or a combination introduced gradually. Progress is reviewed through skills the learner can apply, not by age or pages completed alone."}]],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What the learner can work toward"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"outcome-grid","children":[["$","div","Begin at the first skill that genuinely needs attention",{"className":"outcome-item","children":["$L12"," ","Begin at the first skill that genuinely needs attention"]}],"$L13","$L14","$L15"]}],"$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d",["$L1e","$L1f"],false,"$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25"],"$L26","$L27"]}],"$L28"]}]}],"$L29","$L2a","$L2b"]}]
